      {
        "@value": "Kent, K., Chevalier, S., Grance, T. & Dang, H. (2006) Guide to Integrating Forensic Techniques into Incident Response. NIST Special Publication 800‑86. National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST). Available at: https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/legacy/sp/nistspecialpublication800-86.pdf "
