    ],
    "https://ontology.solveit-df.org/solveit/core/techniqueDetails": [
      {
        "@value": "Artifacts extracted may be a direct mapping to lower levels of abstraction e.g. a database field 'message content' may map to an artifact 'message content', but in many cases, automated interpretation is applied where a field such as 'flag' containing numeric values, may be mapped to more meaningful text strings in the extracted artifact."
      }
    ],
